year: 2025
version: "V1"

abstract: >
  This repository contains data and code associated with a benchmark dataset
  for crack path prediction in functionally graded plates using the phase-field
  fracture method. It is intended to support reproducibility, benchmarking,
  and future scientific machine learning applications in computational mechanics.

keywords:
  - phase-field fracture
  - functionally graded materials
  - crack propagation
  - benchmark dataset
  - computational mechanics
  - fracture mechanics
  - scientific machine learning
